Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-psutil, python3-rich
Description: live CPU, memory and GPU dashboards for the terminal
 LibreStatistics shows how busy your computer is, live, in the terminal, in three
 editions:
  - librestatistics: friendly edition with plain language, apps grouped by name
    and helpful tips
  - librestatistics-dev: developer edition with per-core breakdown, disk, network,
    pressure stalls, GPU engines and a sortable process table
  - librestatistics-classic: the original v1.0 overview
